dana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021114172032/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Unique Amulets \n                            </span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[목걸이]</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/amu2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"33\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Nokozan \nRelic</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Amulet</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Required Level: 10<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20% Faster Hit Recovery</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist \n+50%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10 To Maximum Fire Resist</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 3-6 Fire Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To Light \nRadius</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later)  </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">레벨 \n                            요구치 : 10<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20% 빠른 회복 속도 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 저항력 +50%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10 최대 파이어 저항력</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 데미지 3-6 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 시야 증가</font><br>(1.09 패치이후부터 \n                            얻을 수 있음)</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/amu2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"33\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>The Eye of \nEtlich</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Amulet</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"213\